{
  "chapter.475548C263636219.title": "&dGuhpixel",
  "chapter.475548C263636219.chapter_subtitle": [
    "14. The minigame server of the guhs. /lobby, Nyeg!",
  ],
  "quest.47554813E081AD7B.title": "How Do You Get Here?",
  "quest.47554813E081AD7B.quest_desc": [
    "This chapter comes after &6The Super Compass&r in &dThe Guhmension&r: in the &dMinigames&r tab there, pick the &dGuh Internet Café \"The Slow Connection\"&r.",
    "",
    "In the café guhs are asleep behind old beige computers. Walk through the big screen and you're standing in the lobby of &dGuhpixel&r: the minigame server of the guhs. After that &6/lobby&r, &6/hub&r and &6/l&r work everywhere.",
    "",
    "Play the joke games, earn &6Guhpixel Coins&r (not an item: they are on your name) and buy things for your home with them: the Guhcade, the Guh Office and the Guh Cinema. The &dTravel Agency&r and the &dGuh Parkour&r are simply in the Guhmension. Nothing is locked: every quest ticks itself off as soon as you've done it, even if you did it before. The headings show what logically comes next. Tick this off and get chonking!",
  ],
  "quest.475548AC675103AC.title": "The Slow Connection",
  "quest.475548AC675103AC.quest_desc": [
    "Somewhere in the Guhmension stands a little beige building with a dish on its roof: the &dGuh Internet Café \"The Slow Connection\"&r. Your Super Compass (tab &dMinigames&r) shows the way. Inside, guhs are asleep behind old computers, and the &fAdmin Guh&r asks whether you have tried turning it off and on again. Nyeg.",
  ],
  "quest.4755480367800A14.title": "Connected!",
  "quest.4755480367800A14.quest_desc": [
    "In the internet café, walk straight through the &dgiant screen&r. Beeeeep krrr... and you are in the lobby of &dGuhpixel&r! From now on &e/lobby&r (or &e/hub&r, or &e/l&r) works everywhere. Talk to the &eWelcome Guh&r: it gives you a &bNetwork Cable&r.",
  ],
  "quest.475548CAE2BE14CB.title": "A Gate for Home",
  "quest.475548CAE2BE14CB.quest_desc": [
    "With the &bNetwork Cable&r from the Welcome Guh you make a &dGuhpixel Gate&r at home: iron, glass, redstone and the cable in the middle. Right-click the little screen and off you go, to the lobby. Lost the cable? The Welcome Guh has another one.",
  ],
  "quest.47554852CDD9EA16.title": "Rooftop Runner",
  "quest.47554852CDD9EA16.quest_desc": [
    "On the east side of the lobby lies a green &astart plate&r. Step off it and the clock runs: over the AFK Corner, the floating cushions and the roofs of all the stalls to the &ffinish&r on the roof of the shop. Falling doesn't hurt. The first time you get 50 coins.",
  ],
  "quest.475548C7D82A87BD.title": "Nibble Sleuth",
  "quest.475548C7D82A87BD.quest_desc": [
    "&6Ten golden nibbles&r are hidden in the lobby: behind things, on roofs and... under the ground. Right-click them: every nibble is 10 coins. They stay where they are for everyone, so nobody snatches them from under your nose.",
  ],
  "quest.47554810A339D3A4.title": "Most Valuable Guh",
  "quest.47554810A339D3A4.quest_desc": [
    "Your &drank&r stands in front of your name and depends on all the coins you ever earned: &7[GUH]&r, &a[CHONK]&r (250), &b[CHONK+]&r (750), &6[MVG]&r (1250) and &d[MVG++]&r (1750). Become at least &6[MVG]&r. Spending is just fine!",
  ],
}
